  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk | Goffstown, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n\t\t\t Search \n     Government   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Community   \t\t\t \n     How Do I...   \t\t\t \r\nStay Informed \nGet news and updates sent right to your phone or inbox! \r\n\t\t\t Sign Up for Notifications \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Hall \nTown Clerk \r\nTown Clerk\t\t \r\nOverview \nWelcome to the Town Clerk's page! The Town Clerk's Office is staffed by an elected Town Clerk, a Deputy Town Clerk, and a full-time Clerk II who, together, perform a variety of revenue-collecting assignments. Additionally, this office provides Notary Public services. The Town Clerk is the keeper of records and handles questions regarding: \nAbsentee Ballots \nBirth and Death Certificates \nBoat Registrations \nDog Licenses (Dog Licensing FAQ page) \nElections (Elections page) \nMarriage Certificates (PDF) \nTown Records \nVehicle Registrations \nVital Records \nVoter Registration \nForms \nTo learn more about forms, check out our dedicated  Town Clerk Forms page . \nInformation \nIn an attempt to be helpful, Goffstown Town Clerk information, procedures, and service details have been paraphrased throughout this website. In all circumstances, the applicable RSA and/or NH Administrative Rule shall apply regardless of the phrasing provided herein. \nDog Licensing FAQ page \nMarriage Licenses (PDF)  document (marriage licenses can be obtained by appointment only) \nNH State RSA Number 5-C:17  Vital Records Search Policy (PDF) \nBoards & Committees \nRecords Retention Committee Members page \nSupervisors of the Checklist Members page \nExternal Links \nState of New Hampshire DMV website \nNH Secretary of State's website \nNew DMV Fees Eff. 01/2026 \nOnline Registration & Records \nOnline Registration and Records \nYou will be charged additional vendor processing convenience fees when registering online. \nVehicle Registration & Estimate \nOnline: if you would like to renew your vehicle registration online, check out our  Vehicle E-Registration page . \nOnline: if you would like to get a vehicle registration estimate, check out our  Vehicle E-Registration Estimate page . \nDog Registration \nOnline: if you would like to renew your dog registration online, check out our  Dog E-Registration page . \nMail: if you would like to register or renew your dog registration by mail, check out our dedicated  Town Clerk Forms page . \nVital Records \nOnline: if you would like to obtain vital records online, check out our  Vital Records E-Registration page . \r\nStaff Info \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJennifer Sullivan\r\nTown Clerk \r\n\t\t\t\t\tJodi Morel\r\nClerk  \r\nOffice Info \r\nTown Clerk \r\nEmail \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t 16 Main St \n\t\t\t\t\t Goffstown ,  NH   03045 \r\n16 Main St  Goffstown NH 03045 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t 16 Main St \n\t\t\t\t\t\t Town Clerk Office \n\t\t\t\t\t Goffstown ,  NH   03045 \r\nPhone:  (603) 497-8990 Ext. 811 \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing FAQ \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Prior Years \r\n\t\t\t Online Registrations & Records \r\n\t\t\t Town Clerk Forms \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t Documents &  Maps \r\n\t\t\t Public Notices \r\n\t\t\t Employment opportunities \r\n\t\t\t Economic Development \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Hall Offices  \n16 Main Street \nGoffstown, NH 03045  \nPhone:  603-497-8990   \nFax: 603-497-8993 \r\nHelpful Links \r\n         Agendas & Minutes \n         Employment Opportunities \n         Election Information \n         Parks & Recreation \n         Online Resources \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Contact Us \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
